# The files below are compared byte for byte against the output of a generator that writes LF,
# so a working copy that checked them out with CRLF would fail the comparison on a developer's
# machine while passing in CI. `core.autocrlf` is a per-machine setting; this is not.
#
#   docs/config.contract.json   diffed against `config-schema --format contract`
#   Dockerfile                  its LABEL block diffed against `--format dockerfile`, and it is
#                               read by a Linux builder besides
#   .github/scripts/*.sh        run by `bash` on a Linux runner
/docs/config.contract.json text eol=lf
/Dockerfile text eol=lf
/.github/scripts/*.sh text eol=lf
